    "implementation_constraints":  [
                                       "Do not bulk-move unknown global inbox files into the active instance inbox.",
                                       "Classify Manager-global versus Hub-owned inputs before migration or rejection.",
                                       "Validate instance binding for Hub-owned artifacts before any ownership transition.",
                                       "Handle destination collisions fail-closed.",
                                       "Do not delete the only reachable pending input before the registry commit is proven durable and post-commit cleanup is safe.",
                                       "Recovery switch/rebind must be target-driven and must not require the old active Hub to be healthy.",
                                       "Rebind preserves instance_id and changes registered vault_path only after exact target validation.",
                                       "The final pre-commit predicate must be at least as strong as the predicate required for the resulting active state.",
                                       "Doctor and ListInstances remain usable as diagnostics when active selection or an active/inactive vault is broken.",
                                       "All tests use sanitized/disposable Hubs; no personal Hub bytes enter fixtures, evidence or knowledge."
